# ── Leanest repo ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Push ONLY the code + environment needed to rebuild and run on the cluster.
# Everything is ignored by default; the essentials are re-included below.
# (Notebooks, figures, paper, datasets, run outputs stay on disk locally —
#  they are simply not pushed. To track something extra, add a `!` line.)

/*

# Essentials (re-included):
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Project.toml
!/Manifest.toml
!/src/
!/test/
!/cluster/

# cluster env manifest — kept local only, not pushed:
/cluster/Manifest.toml
/cluster/error/
/cluster/output/

# Junk to drop even inside the tracked folders:
.DS_Store
*.swp
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.cov
gks*.png
slurm-*.out
